\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Yea, Lord, we greet thee,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 Born this happy morning;
\par Jesus, to thee be glory given:
\par Word of the Father,
\par Now in flesh appearing: \b 
